{
  "S1": [
    {
      "text": "It's six forty-five",
      "start": 0.04,
      "end": 1.65
    },
    {
      "text": "in the morning.",
      "start": 1.67,
      "end": 3.12
    },
    {
      "text": "Marco just called in sick.",
      "start": 3.14,
      "end": 5.73
    },
    {
      "text": "Four customers are waiting",
      "start": 5.75,
      "end": 7.38
    },
    {
      "text": "for him today.",
      "start": 7.4,
      "end": 8.86
    },
    {
      "text": "Who covers his jobs?",
      "start": 8.88,
      "end": 11.4
    },
    {
      "text": "Figuring that out",
      "start": 11.42,
      "end": 12.49
    },
    {
      "text": "by hand takes an hour.",
      "start": 12.51,
      "end": 14.86
    },
    {
      "text": "Second Shift does it",
      "start": 14.88,
      "end": 16.37
    },
    {
      "text": "in seconds.",
      "start": 16.39,
      "end": 17.55
    }
  ],
  "S2": [
    {
      "text": "Someone posts in Slack:",
      "start": 0.04,
      "end": 2.81
    },
    {
      "text": "Marco is out.",
      "start": 2.83,
      "end": 4.53
    },
    {
      "text": "Second Shift reads it,",
      "start": 4.55,
      "end": 6.35
    },
    {
      "text": "then looks at every job",
      "start": 6.37,
      "end": 8.09
    },
    {
      "text": "and every calendar.",
      "start": 8.11,
      "end": 9.86
    }
  ],
  "S3": [
    {
      "text": "It builds a new plan.",
      "start": 0.04,
      "end": 2.22
    },
    {
      "text": "Watch the trucks move.",
      "start": 2.24,
      "end": 4.41
    },
    {
      "text": "Wei can do Marco's",
      "start": 4.43,
      "end": 6.31
    },
    {
      "text": "big gas job,",
      "start": 6.33,
      "end": 7.95
    },
    {
      "text": "but he's busy.",
      "start": 7.97,
      "end": 9.65
    },
    {
      "text": "So Ana takes",
      "start": 9.67,
      "end": 10.94
    },
    {
      "text": "Wei's small job,",
      "start": 10.96,
      "end": 12.7
    },
    {
      "text": "and Wei takes Marco's.",
      "start": 12.72,
      "end": 15.04
    },
    {
      "text": "One job can't",
      "start": 15.06,
      "end": 16.46
    },
    {
      "text": "be saved today,",
      "start": 16.48,
      "end": 18.25
    },
    {
      "text": "so that customer is asked",
      "start": 18.27,
      "end": 19.85
    },
    {
      "text": "to pick a new time.",
      "start": 19.87,
      "end": 21.61
    }
  ],
  "S4": [
    {
      "text": "Nothing changes until",
      "start": 0.04,
      "end": 1.77
    },
    {
      "text": "a person says yes.",
      "start": 1.79,
      "end": 3.91
    },
    {
      "text": "One click,",
      "start": 3.93,
      "end": 5.14
    },
    {
      "text": "and it updates the calendars",
      "start": 5.16,
      "end": 7.0
    },
    {
      "text": "and the job sheet,",
      "start": 7.02,
      "end": 8.53
    },
    {
      "text": "messages the team in Slack,",
      "start": 8.55,
      "end": 10.95
    },
    {
      "text": "and emails the customers.",
      "start": 10.97,
      "end": 13.16
    }
  ],
  "S5": [
    {
      "text": "Then it double-checks every change.",
      "start": 0.05,
      "end": 3.15
    },
    {
      "text": "Thirty-six out of thirty-six.",
      "start": 3.17,
      "end": 6.53
    },
    {
      "text": "If it crashes halfway,",
      "start": 6.55,
      "end": 8.99
    },
    {
      "text": "it finishes",
      "start": 9.01,
      "end": 10.06
    },
    {
      "text": "without sending anything twice.",
      "start": 10.08,
      "end": 13.16
    },
    {
      "text": "And you can ask:",
      "start": 13.18,
      "end": 14.89
    },
    {
      "text": "what if Wei",
      "start": 14.91,
      "end": 15.84
    },
    {
      "text": "doesn't show up?",
      "start": 15.86,
      "end": 17.35
    },
    {
      "text": "It shows you,",
      "start": 17.37,
      "end": 18.81
    },
    {
      "text": "before it happens.",
      "start": 18.83,
      "end": 20.8
    }
  ],
  "S6": [
    {
      "text": "Sick days,",
      "start": 0.04,
      "end": 1.23
    },
    {
      "text": "flat tires, no-shows.",
      "start": 1.25,
      "end": 4.28
    },
    {
      "text": "They'll keep happening.",
      "start": 4.3,
      "end": 6.48
    },
    {
      "text": "Now they take seconds",
      "start": 6.5,
      "end": 8.4
    },
    {
      "text": "to fix,",
      "start": 8.42,
      "end": 9.86
    },
    {
      "text": "not an hour.",
      "start": 9.88,
      "end": 11.57
    },
    {
      "text": "We can't predict the day.",
      "start": 11.59,
      "end": 14.05
    },
    {
      "text": "But we can be ready",
      "start": 14.07,
      "end": 15.7
    },
    {
      "text": "for it.",
      "start": 15.72,
      "end": 16.78
    },
    {
      "text": "Second Shift.",
      "start": 16.8,
      "end": 18.06
    }
  ]
}